    "prompt": "The BooedUp dating app tracks profile updates to identify users who may need re-engagement prompts. Write a query that returns each profile update event along with the number of days since that user's previous update. For a user's first update in the dataset, the days_since_previous_update should be NULL. Include all update events. Order the results by user_id ascending, then update_timestamp ascending. Your output must include: user_id, update_timestamp, days_since_previous_update.",
